格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The Feishu UI for DeepSeek Harness — a panel-driven control console: every slash command a button on the ⚙️ control-panel card, in-card approvals & questions, live streaming cards, one-QR setup. | DeepSeek Harness 的飞书 UI：面板驱动控制台——每个命令都是卡片按钮，卡内审批与提问，流式卡片，扫码一键配置。","id":"gh:1333870105","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-feishu","slug":"PGZXB/dsh-feishu","topics":["ai-agent","bot","chatbot","coding-agent","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","feishu","feishu-bot","im-bot","interactive-cards","lark","llm","nodejs","streaming","typescript","websocket"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The Feishu UI for DeepSeek Harness — a panel-driven control console: every slash command a button on"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" the ⚙️ control-panel card, in-card approvals & questions, live streaming cards, one-QR setup. | Dee"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"pSeek Harness 的飞书 UI：面板驱动控制台——每个命令都是卡片按钮，卡内审批与提问，流式卡片，扫码一键配置。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# The Feishu UI for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The Feishu UI for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) — a dsh-native plugin with a **panel-driven control console"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"**: every slash command is a button on the ⚙️ control-panel card, approvals and questions resolve in"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"side the chat, and one QR scan sets the whole app up."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Note:** DeepSeek Harness is\n> still pre-release and may break between releases. dsh-feishu is bu"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ilt and\n> verified against **dsh `@latest`** — currently **`0.2.1-rc.2`** — both when\n> installed fr"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"om npm and from git."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9163793-52f2-4e2c-a08a-22b27372be61"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"*2.5-min demo: control panel, streaming card, approval and question.*"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quickstart"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Install from npm"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Install from source"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then message the bot in Feishu. The setup wizard handles the Feishu app end\nto end — no web-console "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"work and no manual credentials. Already have an app?\nSet `FEISHU_APP_ID` / `FEISHU_APP_SECRET` (envi"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ronment or profile config)\ninstead — see docs/feishu-setup.md."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"A Feishu chat is a dsh session — the bot is the agent's avatar. A typical\nsession goes like this:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. **Start a chat.** Direct-message the bot, or run `/group <name>` to\ncreate a group the bot joins."},{"id":"p18s2","text":" In a group, @-mention the bot (the\ndefault policy; a group with just you and the bot also answers p"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"lain\nmessages, and the policy is configurable)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"2. **Open the control panel.** Send `/panel` to pop up the panel card."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"3. **Pick a working directory.** The bot refuses work until the chat has\none: tap **📚 Pick project**"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" to choose from a list (the `/repo`\nequivalent), or **📁 Change dir** to type a path (the `/cd <path>"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"m a list (the `/repo`\nequivalent), or **📁 Change dir** to type a path (the `/cd <path>`\nequivalent)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"4. **Ask.** Send a message — the agent runs and its output streams into a\nlive card (tool calls, rea"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"soning, markdown, tables). The card ends green\nwith the full answer inside; Stop, copy, retry, and t"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"he ⚙️ panel button\nsit on it."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Mid-stream | Finalized |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"5. **Approve or answer when asked.** A permission escalation posts an\napproval card — tap **Allow on"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ce** (or **Reject**). A question posts a\ncard you answer with a tap (or a reply)."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Approval | Question |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"6. **Manage sessions.** Tap **🗂️ Sessions** to list saved sessions and\nresume any of them from the c"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ard (the `/sessions` equivalent; `/resume\n<id>` moves one into this chat), and tap **➕ New chat** (t"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"he `/clear`\nequivalent) to start fresh without deleting the old one."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Every button on the panel card maps to a slash command — pick whichever\nfeels faster; `/help` lists "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ton on the panel card maps to a slash command — pick whichever\nfeels faster; `/help` lists them all."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Commands"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Command | What it does |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| `/help` | list all commands |\n| `/panel` | open the control-panel card (all commands as buttons) |"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"\n| `/group <name>` | create a group with the bot (bare opens a name-input card) |\n| `/cancel` | stop"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" the running turn |\n| `/cd <path>` | set this chat's working directory (bare opens a path-input card"},{"id":"p29s4","text":") |\n| `/repo [path]` | pick a project directory (bare scans the default roots; `/repo <path>` scans "},{"id":"p29s5","text":"that path) |\n| `/status` | show this chat's session status |\n| `/feishu-status` | show the surface d"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"iagnostic card |\n| `/schedule` | list active reminders |\n| `/model <provider/model>` | switch this s"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"ession's model (bare opens the picker) |\n| `/export` | send this chat's session log as a file |\n| `/"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"log` | send the dsh-feishu log file to this chat (handy for debugging — please attach the key log li"},{"id":"p29s9","text":"nes when you file an issue) |\n| `/sessions` | list saved sessions (resume any of them from the card)"},{"id":"p29s10","text":" |\n| `/resume <id>` | resume a saved session (bare opens the session list) |\n| `/clear` `/new` | sta"},{"id":"p29s11","text":"rt a fresh conversation (the old session stays saved) |\n| `/goal <text>` | set the task goal (bare o"},{"id":"p29s12","text":"pens a text-input card) |\n| `/compact` | compact older conversation history |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Live streaming cards** — tool calls, reasoning, markdown, and tables stream in as the agent work"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"s.\n- **One-tap control panel** — `/panel` renders the full command palette as buttons; no command sy"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ntax to remember, and each button is the exact equivalent of typing the command.\n- **In-card approva"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ls & questions** — approve a permission escalation or answer the agent's questions in the chat.\n- **"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"Sessions survive restarts** — a chat's session and its working directory are persisted across daemon"},{"id":"p31s6","text":" restarts; `/sessions` lists, resumes, renames, archives, and exports them.\n- **One-QR quick setup**"},{"id":"p31s7","text":" — a single Feishu QR scan creates and configures the app (bot profile, scopes, event subscriptions,"},{"id":"p31s8","text":" credentials) and writes the dsh profile.\n- **Files in both directions** — images, files, videos, an"},{"id":"p31s9","text":"d rich-text posts you send land in the workspace as plain files the agent reads by path; the agent c"},{"id":"p31s10","text":"an send workspace files and images back to the chat.\n- **Message queue & steering** — messages sent "},{"id":"p31s11","text":"while a turn is running queue visibly; edit, delete, or steer them into the running turn.\n- **Files "},{"id":"p31s12","text":"a turn produced** — appear as chips at the bottom of the card; tap one to receive it in the chat.\n- "},{"id":"p31s13","text":"**Card stats & diagnostics** — turns, tool calls, tokens, and current context-window occupancy on th"},{"id":"p31s14","text":"e card; `/feishu-status` shows connection and session diagnostics, and stays usable mid-turn.\n- **Gr"},{"id":"p31s15","text":"oups & mentions** — @-mention the bot; error notices, approvals, and questions @ the requester.\n- **"},{"id":"p31s16","text":"Reactions, allowlists, reminders, export** — reaction ack, `allowedChats` / `allowedUsers`, schedule"},{"id":"p31s17","text":"d reminders, and session-log files."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
